{"id":21815,"slug":"the-story-of-a-cheat","title":"The Story of a Cheat","year":1936,"country":"France","duration":81,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/21815-the-story-of-a-cheat","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/91ab8ebb9355552d6438b952288257c5/W1z52IebKI95zHXmlisR804CzQt5kj_large.jpg","description":"Considered Sacha Guitry’s masterpiece, this fleet, witty picaresque about a gambler and petty thief is a whimsical delight. Guitry himself stars as the tricheur looking back fondly on a life of crime, which he narrates with an effervescence matched by that of the film's skillful editing and cinematography. With its rapid storytelling and novel use of voice-over, _The Story of a Cheat_ has influenced filmmakers from Orson Welles to François Truffaut.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Sacha Guitry","slug":"sacha-guitry"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Sacha Guitry","role":"Cheat (mature)","slug":"sacha-guitry"},{"actor":"Marguerite Moreno","role":"Countess","slug":"marguerite-moreno"},{"actor":"Jacqueline Delubac","role":"Henriette","slug":"jacqueline-delubac"},{"actor":"Roger Duchesne","role":"Serge Abramich","slug":"roger-duchesne"},{"actor":"Rosine Deréan","role":"Jewel Thief","slug":"rosine-derean"},{"actor":"Elmire Vautier","role":"Countess (younger)","slug":"elmire-vautier"},{"actor":"Serge Grave","role":"Cheat (boy)","slug":"serge-grave"},{"actor":"Pauline Carton","role":"Madame Morlot","slug":"pauline-carton"},{"actor":"Pierre Assay","role":"Cheat (young man)","slug":"pierre-assay"},{"actor":"Henri Pfeifer","role":"Monsieur Charbonnier","slug":"henri-pfeifer"},{"actor":"Gaston Dupray","role":"Waiter","slug":"gaston-dupray"},{"actor":"Pierre Labry","role":"Cousin Morlot","slug":"pierre-labry"},{"actor":"Fréhel","role":"Redhead","slug":"frehel"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Sacha Guitry","slug":"sacha-guitry"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Serge Sandberg .","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay by","person":"Sacha